      "statement": "`Engine::load_wav` decodes synchronously at the default output device sample rate and stores a `Sound` under a `SoundHandle`; WAV loading only supports one or two channels, reads i16 samples, linearly resamples mono or stereo data, and panics for unsupported channels or unwrapped I/O/decode failures.",
